.env
.DS_Store
node_modules/
fixtures/
# ILB-Arena fixtures are hand-written test corpora consumed by suites/ilb-arena/run.js;
# they must travel with the repo (CI cannot regenerate them) so they're allow-listed here.
!/suites/ilb-arena/fixtures/
!/suites/ilb-arena/fixtures/**

# Case-registry fixtures are the same kind and for a sharper reason: ILB-0136
# asserts `import-next/no-cycle` reports on a two-module cycle, and a cycle is a
# property of the module GRAPH — no single source string can express one, so the
# resolver needs `b.ts` to exist on disk. Ignored, the case verified only on
# machines that happened to have the directory and REGRESSED on every clean
# clone. A claim that cannot be checked from a fresh checkout is not a claim.
!/cases/fixtures/
!/cases/fixtures/**
results/*.json
!results/.gitkeep
